# jaws_pro 1.02 - PAD-420: one port per newest build, from this build's framework-generation draft and the same
# title's proven port, with other titles' feature lines taken out (docs/plans/pad420_mode_sweep.md).
# Emulator-proven 2026-10-08 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, the stock card, hidden, muted):
# the runtime hooked the game, 23 of its 24 shots came from their switches, a drain ended a ball,
# a tilted ball and three balls to the game's end; events seen firing: game_start, ball_start, ball_end, bonus_end, tilt_warning, tilt, game_over.
# Shots no press made: Mid flipper lane. Jaws LE's upper-playfield shots (Ship wheel, Upper playfield ramp, Upper
# playfield target) are left out: a Pro has no upper playfield (no UP PF switches in its switch list).

game           jaws_pro
version        1.02

